      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.1.05-06",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A youthful population can provide a future workforce, innovation and a larger market if health, education and employment opportunities develop suitably. The potential is not automatic. Large cohorts entering adulthood can face unemployment or underemployment if useful work does not grow. The idea of a demographic opportunity depends on enabling conditions, not merely the presence of many young people.",
